      "description": "Applegreen Electric Irish Pay-Per-Use",
      "serviceProviderId": 6,
      "showInFilterList": true,
      "htmlDesc": "<div class=\"p-15\"><div class=\"price-clean p-0 front\" style=\"background:#ffffff\"><div class=\"price-clean-header p-15\" style=\"background:#337882\"><div><span style=\"color:#ffffff;font-family:&#39;arial&#39; , &#39;helvetica&#39; , sans-serif\">Applegreen Electric Irish Pay-Per-Use</span></div></div><p><br />A plan which allows you to pay a simple price per kWh at all our charging stations.</p><div class=\"p-15\"><div style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14pt;color:#337882;font-family:&#39;arial&#39; , &#39;helvetica&#39; , sans-serif\">Pay per kWh</span></strong><br /><strong><span style=\"font-size:14pt;color:#337882;font-family:&#39;arial&#39; , &#39;helvetica&#39; , sans-serif\">No subscription fee and no connection fee. </span></strong><br /><br /></div><p>This is the best option for fast charging, as well as the best value for EV drivers as you only pay for what you use!<br /><br />Check within the driver portal or app for specific station pricing. All pricing rates vary by location and all rates are subject to change at any time.</p></div><div class=\"p-15\"><span style=\"font-family:&#39;arial&#39; , &#39;helvetica&#39; , sans-serif\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"price-plan-signup-btn btn btn-default size-13 h-30\" style=\"line-height:15px !important\"> SIGN ME UP </a></span></div></div></div>",
      "mobileDesc": "<p>A plan which allows you to pay a simple price per kWh at all our charging stations. </p><h4>Pay a price per kWh</h4><p><span style=\"font-size:10pt\">This is the best option for fast charging, as well as the best value for EV drivers as you only pay for what you use. </span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:&#39;arial&#39; , sans-serif;text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:&#39;arial&#39; , sans-serif\">Check within the app for specific station pricing. All pricing rates vary by location and all rates are subject to change at any time</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:0cm;line-height:18pt;text-align:center\" align=\"center\"><br /></p>",
